# 🧩 Modelo de Domínio (Go)

### `internal/domain/class.go`

```go
package domain

type ClassTier string

const (
	TierBase     ClassTier = "BASE"
	TierAdvanced ClassTier = "ADVANCED"
	TierElite    ClassTier = "ELITE"
)

type Class struct {
	ID           int64
	Name         string
	BaseClass    string // Blade Monk, Sword Disciple etc
	Tier         ClassTier
	MinLevel     int
	AtkBonus     int
	HpBonus      int
	EnergyBonus  int
}
```

