## 🗄️ Script de Banco – PostgreSQL

### 📌 Tabela de Classes

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS classes (
	id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
	name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
	base_class VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
	tier VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
	min_level INTEGER NOT NULL,

	atk_bonus INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
	hp_bonus INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
	energy_bonus INTEGER DEFAULT 0
);
```

---

### 📌 Ajuste na tabela de players

```sql
ALTER TABLE players
ADD COLUMN class_id INTEGER REFERENCES classes(id),
ADD COLUMN can_evolve BOOLEAN DEFAULT false;
```

